  "body": "**The auction of 5/91 Speight Road, St Heliers has been brought forward to 4pm, Thursday 29 October 2026 | In Rooms - Ray White Mt Eden**\r\n\r\nSunny, simple and just 450 metres to Tamaki Drive. This renovated two bedroom unit sits in a small block of units on Speight Road, moments from St Heliers Beach and village. North facing and flooded with light, it's on a cross lease title with no body corporate, making it a genuinely easy way into one of Auckland's most loved coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nInside, the open plan living flows straight onto a sunny balcony, perfect for morning coffee or a quiet wine after work. The kitchen has been freshly updated, both bedrooms are well sized, and the modern finishes mean there's nothing to do but move in. Ideal for professional couples, downsizers ready to lock up and leave, or investors after a low-maintenance asset in a suburb that always holds its appeal.\r\n\r\nAgent Conjunctionals Welcome | Viewing By Appointment or Advertised Open Homes",
